{"3854090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gaming Journo Simulator", "steam_appid": 3854090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/extras/b28020e057927e0b118a99319d7907e2.avif?t=1781957377\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/extras_big/b28020e057927e0b118a99319d7907e2.avif?t=1781957377 width=800 height=337 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Woke Gamer – a gaming news site that pushes Woke ideology under the guise of news, previews and reviews. You play as Mark, a new diversity hired to write articles for the site. Will you write Woke articles and try to push the “message”, or will you write Based articles and speak for the fans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be Woke or be Based - your choices determine Mark’s career in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><u><i><strong>Shape your career</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark career will be determined by the choices you make. Push for an agenda and you will climb the corporate ladder. Speak for the fandom, and your time at Woke Gamer will be cut short.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Do your job as an editor</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An editor is defined by the quality of articles he/she writes. Mark is no different. Pick the right option to craft the article you want to see published. But, be warned though - the internet WILL react to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Diverse cast of characters</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As is with most games nowadays, you can interact with a diverse cast of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Use your power wisely:</strong></i></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call out gamers for their misogyny, homophobia and bigotry. Or, side with them and call out the forced DEI initiatives in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Your choices matter: </strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you are going to make in the game will be remembered by other characters. Choose your options carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Replayability:</strong></i></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are not happy with your first run, try playing it again and make different decisions. With multiple endings to unlock, who knows what you might discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Accessible by everyone:</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not have a hard mode so even gaming journalists can play it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/extras/b28020e057927e0b118a99319d7907e2.avif?t=1781957377\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/extras_big/b28020e057927e0b118a99319d7907e2.avif?t=1781957377 width=800 height=337 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Woke Gamer – a gaming news site that pushes Woke ideology under the guise of news, previews and reviews. You play as Mark, a new diversity hired to write articles for the site. Will you write Woke articles and try to push the “message”, or will you write Based articles and speak for the fans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be Woke or be Based - your choices determine Mark’s career in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><u><i><strong>Shape your career</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark career will be determined by the choices you make. Push for an agenda and you will climb the corporate ladder. Speak for the fandom, and your time at Woke Gamer will be cut short.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Do your job as an editor</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An editor is defined by the quality of articles he/she writes. Mark is no different. Pick the right option to craft the article you want to see published. But, be warned though - the internet WILL react to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Diverse cast of characters</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As is with most games nowadays, you can interact with a diverse cast of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Use your power wisely:</strong></i></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call out gamers for their misogyny, homophobia and bigotry. Or, side with them and call out the forced DEI initiatives in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Your choices matter: </strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you are going to make in the game will be remembered by other characters. Choose your options carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Replayability:</strong></i></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are not happy with your first run, try playing it again and make different decisions. With multiple endings to unlock, who knows what you might discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Accessible by everyone:</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not have a hard mode so even gaming journalists can play it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Gaming Journo Simulator is a single-player game that lets you play as a journalist and write articles for a game website. Whether you choose to write “woke” articles or “based” – that’s up to you. Just remember: if you want to climb the corporate ladder, you need to play by the rules.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/2308911e15c4b73aa755b99fbde6498d36aabbce/header.jpg?t=1781957377", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/a95db72b29d97373e19b8b297b5b6dee9a282b23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781957377", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/a95db72b29d97373e19b8b297b5b6dee9a282b23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781957377", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R9 390<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10600 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Suneil Angel"], "publishers": ["Suneil Angel"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1